e park, you can playfully explore various careers (optician, retail salesperson, electronics technician - automation technology, mechatronics technician - refrigeration technology) and try out typical job tasks. Whether it's technology, healthcare, or skilled trades \u2013 find out what you like most! :)\n\nEarly Access: Be among the first to test jobVRiety and help us further develop the experience!\n\nFeatures:\n- Interactive adventure park with mini-games \u2013 Discover different industries in a colorful environment.\n- Virtual internship \u2013 Take on real-life tasks from various professions and experience playful learning.\n- Intuitive VR controls \u2013 Easy navigation and interaction", "short_description": "Experience career orientation in a whole new way with jobVRiety: in virtual reality! In your interactive career adventure park, you can playfully explore various professions (optician, retail salesperson, electronics technician - automation technology, mechatronics technician - refrigeration technology) and try out typical job tasks. Whether it's technology, healthcare, or skilled trades \u2013 find out what you like most! :)\n\nEarly Access: Be among the first to test jobVRiety!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://meramo.de/jobvriety-datenschutzrichtlinie/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meramo Verlag GmbH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.meramo.de/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["de"], "supported_inp